            "review_title": "Review at Quan Dai Duong Chinh Hieu",
            "review_text": "Ngoc Ton\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nA super-delicious chinese restaurant\nMay 2019 • Couples\nFamous for a very long time ago, especially in black chicken medicine soup, very nice old waiters, waitresses and cooks. Really enjoy the soup water, other things like \"mi xao gion\" or fried noodle also make me so enjoyed. Highly recommend for a quick and delicious and healthy meal.\nWritten May 21, 2019",
